{"strongs": "H6144", "word": "עָר", "translit": "ar", "root": "עקר", "morph": "N:N--L", "pos": "proper name, of a location", "gloss": "in Moab, south of Arnon", "definition": "I. עָר proper name, of a location in Moab, south of Arnon ( Ηρ Num 21:15 , elsewhere chiefly Αροηρ ); — ׳ ע Num 21:15 ; Deut 2:9 ; Deut 2:18 ; Deut 2:29 עָר מוֺאָד Num 21:28 ; Isa 15:1 — usually interpreted as capital city ( עָר = עִיר ) of Moab ( DHM ZMG xxxvii (1883), 398 compare Sabean ער fortified height , compare Mordtm Him. Inschr. 29 Hal Ét. Sab. 159 so Arabic , dialect of Yemen); Buhl Geogr.269 f. thinks name of district South of Arnon.", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6343')\">BDB6343</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H6144')\">H6144</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6342')\">BDB6342</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6344')\">BDB6344</entry></div><p> I. <bdbheb>עָר</bdbheb> <b>proper name, of a location</b> <highlightword>in Moab, south of Arnon</highlightword> (<grk>Ηρ</grk> <ref ref=\"Num 21:15\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(4,21,15)\">Num 21:15</ref>, elsewhere chiefly <grk>Αροηρ</grk>); — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ע</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 21:15\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(4,21,15)\">Num 21:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 2:9\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(5,2,9)\">Deut 2:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 2:18\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(5,2,18)\">Deut 2:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 2:29\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(5,2,29)\">Deut 2:29</ref> <bdbheb>עָר מוֺאָד</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 21:28\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(4,21,28)\">Num 21:28</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 15:1\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(23,15,1)\">Isa 15:1</ref>